---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
import strip from '../data/family-strip.json';
---
<Layout title="About" active="about" description="Why I built Roots & Pantry: family recipes, local food, and a free app made in Wellington, Telford.">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div class="about-text">
      <div class="pagehead">
        <h1>About Roots &amp; Pantry</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <figure class="me">
          <img src="/img/jason-lewis.webp" alt="Jason Lewis, founder of Roots &amp; Pantry" width="350" height="399" />
          <figcaption>Jason, founder</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="hand">Hi, I'm Jason.</p>
        <p>I live in Wellington, Telford, with my family, and I've spent my career in cyber security.</p>
        <p>Our family recipes used to be everywhere: handwritten cards, screenshots, bookmarked websites and photos spread across everyone's phones. So I built us a private recipe website. Now the whole family uses it, from the grandparents to the kids, and the photos on this page come from it.</p>
        <p>While shopping for ingredients, I kept thinking about the brilliant small producers around Shropshire that most people never hear about. Farms, bakers, cheese makers and market stalls, all competing with the supermarkets.</p>
        <p>So I put the two together. Roots &amp; Pantry gives families a free, private cookbook, and gives local producers a free way to reach those families right when they're deciding what to cook.</p>
        <h2>What I believe</h2>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li><b>Food brings families together.</b> Recipes are part of a family's story.</li>
          <li><b>Local is better.</b> Money spent with independent producers stays in the community.</li>
          <li><b>Privacy matters.</b> No advertising trackers, and I'll never sell your data.</li>
          <li><b>Everyone should be able to use it</b>, whatever their age or ability.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Why it's free</h2>
        <p>It costs very little to run, and I'd rather it was used than paid for. If optional extras for producers ever help cover costs, they'll be clearly labelled and never based on tracking anyone.</p>
        <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
        <p>Roots &amp; Pantry is a trading name of <a href={site.companyUrl}>{site.company}</a>, my small cyber security company. That's why privacy and security are built in from the start, not added later.</p>
        <p>I'd love to hear from you: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
        <p class="note">Faces in the family photos are blurred until everyone has agreed to be shown.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-photos" aria-label="Family cooking photos">
      <input type="checkbox" id="pause-photos" class="pause-box" />
      <label for="pause-photos" class="pause-btn"><span class="when-moving">Pause photos</span><span class="when-paused">Play photos</span></label>
      <div class="vstrip-window" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Family photos">
        <div class="vstrip">
          {strip.map((s) => (
            <figure class="snap"><img src={s.file} alt={s.caption} width={s.w} height={s.h} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>{s.caption}</figcaption></figure>
          ))}
          {strip.map((s) => (
            <figure class="snap dup" aria-hidden="true"><img src={s.file} alt="" width={s.w} height={s.h} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>{s.caption}</figcaption></figure>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Layout>
